  m_text: Light must herald the beginning of the ritual, while Darkness shall witness
    its end. When Light ascends, Fire must awaken without delay. Though born of the
    same world, Fire and Water are eternal rivals. They may never stand side by side.
    Water is ever faithful, following in the footsteps of Wind. Earth refuses both
    the first step and the final one, choosing instead the path between. Wind wanders
    freely, yet it shall never walk before Fire.
